      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wheeler Auctioneers are delighted to present to market the family home of the late\r\n Ann & Joe Mulcahy of the 'The Maurice Mulcahy Orchestra.\r\nThis is a house guaranteed to hit all the right notes for somebody wishing to acquire a spacious family home in a very desirable location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION COMPRISES:\r\nEntrance Hall\t\t\t4m x 3m\t\t        Cornicing, Carpet\r\nLivingroom (1)\t\t\t6m x 4.2m\t\tMarble Fireplace, Cornicing, Patio Doors to Garden\r\nLivingroom (2) \t\t6m x 4m\t\t        Cornicing, Bay Window, Carpet\r\nDining Room\t\t\t7.1m x 3.6m\t\tQuality Cabinetry, Central Island, Integrated Appliances\r\nKitchen\t \t\t        5.3m x 3m\t\tTiled, Vaulted Ceiling, French Doors to Deck Area\t\r\nWC & Hotpress\r\nWalk-In Linen Room\t\t\t\r\nMaster Bedroom  \t\t4m x 4m\t\t             Ensuite, Dressing room, Carpet\r\nBedroom (2) \t\t\t4m x 3.2m\t             Ensuite, Carpet\r\nBedroom (3) \t\t\t3.6m x 3.6m\t             Ensuite, Carpet\r\nBedroom (4) \t\t\t3.3m x 3m\t             Ensuite, Carpet\r\nBathroom \t\t\t4m x 3m                    \t\r\n\t\t\r\nOutside: Gravel Driveway, Mature Garden to Front, South Facing Rear Garden, Patio Area\r\n\r\nFeatures: Gas Heating (Mains), High level of Insulation, 4 No. Ensuite Bathrooms, uPvc Facia & Sofit"
      },
